cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EnQuiz in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "EnQuiz: an offline-first bilingual quiz app for entrepreneurship revision"
abstract: >-
  EnQuiz is a browser-based revision app for an undergraduate Entrepreneurship
  course. It holds a 300-question bank across five chapters and offers timed mock
  exams, chapter practice with immediate explanations, automatic tracking of missed
  questions, flagging, a per-chapter breakdown of each paper, and an importer that
  matches a pasted question paper to a pasted answer key by question number. The
  interface is bilingual Vietnamese-English with light and dark themes, is narrated
  by a ten-step guided tour recorded in the author's own voice, installs as a
  progressive web app, and continues to work with no network connection. It is
  written in plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript with no framework, no build step and no
  server; all learner data stays in the browser.
